    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like my doctor is always so busy and it's just a little dizziness, not like i'm passing out or anything. it feels like it's just my body trying to catch up to the meds. if i take a bit more today it might just stabilize things quicker so i don't have to deal with this for a week, right? wouldn't a slightly higher dose help my body adjust to the lower pressure faster?",
